ne\ndeciding \\(L\\), and fixed positive integers \\(C,a\\) such that the machine\nruns in time at most \\(C(n+1)^a\\) on every input of length \\(n\\).\nIf \\(f_n\\) is the membership function of \\(L\\) on \\(\\bits^n\\), then\n\\[\n \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{\\log_2 S_3(f_n)}{\\sqrt n}=\\infty.\n\\]\nEquivalently, for every real \\(A>0\\), there is an integer \\(N_A\\)\nsuch that\n\\[\n S_3(f_n)>2^{A\\sqrt n}\\qquad\\text{for every }n\\ge N_A.\n\\]\nNo uniformity or bottom fan-in restriction is imposed on the circuits."},{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:0035fe639d7b1f7ad0d5ca3b27052eec1a9278566c33a1a21fc12425b8e31047","grain":"paper-statement","id":"Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026#prop:polytime","title":"prop:polytime"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/598391019bef7e315c4ffa24.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Proposition","id":"r:Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026:prop:polytime","manuscript_id":"p:Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026","name":"prop:polytime","printed_number":"5.2","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"8056826bbd00caea871ad036bd295182e2bef3e2","binding":{"file":"build/latex/sections/04_construction.tex","label":"prop:polytime","line":72,"manuscript":"Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026","statement_sha256":"64be7bfd802c60f3d7a400bd45f06656a36a45c0560e2396c811c5dfdb220bd4"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"8056826bbd00caea871ad036bd295182e2bef3e2","renderer":"sc